<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοχθ-ηρία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bad condition</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκήνεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					187
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					609e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a person,
				<i>lack of skill, incapacity</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἰατροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					4.2.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κυβερνητῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					302a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in
			moral sense, <i>wickedness, depravity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				159
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				734d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς μ. τῆς ἠλιθιότητος τῆς ἐμῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					188
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρεταὶ καὶ μοχθηρίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1129b24
				</span></i>
			: with a political connotation, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ
				πρῶτα τῆς ἐκεῖ μ.</span> chief <i>of the rascaldom</i>
			(i.e. of the Radical party) up there (on earth), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				425
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
